
@api = http://localhost:5100

### Danh sách sản phẩm → 200
GET {{api}}/api/products

### Sản phẩm không tồn tại → 404 + ApiError
GET {{api}}/api/products/999

### Tạo sản phẩm hợp lệ → 201 Created + Location
POST {{api}}/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Lap trinh gRPC",
  "description": "Tai lieu bai 5",
  "price": 80000
}


### Chi tiet san pham ton tai -> 200
GET {{api}}/api/products/1

### Cap nhat san pham ton tai -> 200
PUT {{api}}/api/products/4
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "Sach C# Nang Cao",
    "description": "Tai lieu C# da cap nhat",
    "price": 150000
}

### Cap nhat san pham khong ton tai -> 404
PUT {{api}}/api/products/999
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "San pham khong ton tai",
    "description": "Kiem tra loi",
    "price": 100000
}

### Xoa san pham ton tai -> 200
DELETE {{api}}/api/products/4

### Xoa san pham khong ton tai -> 404
DELETE {{api}}/api/products/999
